The record at a parameter's field, read again after its update (ownership-v2.md §2.7, the kind `read`; §2.8, a hold
that is not the written record; #2443): a bound field value is the old record whole, a read of a written field is
a hoist, a read of an untouched field is nothing. v1 gives the same verdict, cause and hoist count on every line.
